"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66512.281395,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67394.419987,"text":"يستخدم علماء الحشرات مصطلح \"البق\" بمعناه الرسمي للإشارة إلى هذه المجموعة من الحشرات."},{"kind":"audio","t":67574.918128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67579.85630700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67585.083411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67590.323844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67595.605958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67600.59257600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67605.647222,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67606.40952,"samples":13597,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":74698.633804,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75830.62872600001,"text":"أولاً، معظم الفرسان يرتدون أحذية ركوب ذات كعب ونعل أملس وضيق إلى حد ما."},{"kind":"audio","t":76060.22162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":76065.503193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76070.743847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76076.137378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76081.446681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76085.80467900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76088.926328,"samples":31597,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"input","t":83921.20040100001,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85018.940726,"text":"كانت اللجنة بمثابة رد فعل من مارتيلي على الاحتجاجات الواسعة المناهض